// Dead (muted) notes: @dead is the cross note-head style (LilyPond's \deadNote) — the
// font's noteheads.s2cross on the staff, and the same glyph at the tab head's size in
// place of the fret number. Normal notes are unaffected; stems/beams stay.
part bl { clef bass octave 3 tuning bass }
section A { c4 e@dead g e@dead | c8 c@dead g@dead c g@dead g c c@dead | }
form main { A }
score main { staff bl  tab bl }
